\p \v 1 \w This is the burden|strong="H04853"\w* \w against Nineveh|strong="H05210"\w*, \w the book|strong="H05612"\w* \w of the vision|strong="H02377"\w* \w of Nahum|strong="H05151"\w* \w the Elkoshite|strong="H00512"\w*:
